IMPORT policy

-- Standing preamble (applies to every query): assume all other conditions are met and
-- no other exclusions apply -- i.e. every field not mentioned in the question below is
-- set here to a value that keeps the claim otherwise clean: agreement signed, premium
-- paid on time, wellness visit and its written confirmation both timely, no fraud or
-- misrepresentation, no dispute, and hospitalization safely within the policy term.

-- Q1: hospitalized by burns suffered while doing my duty as a firefighter.
q1 MEANS Claim WITH
    `agreement signed`                  IS TRUE
    `premium paid month`                IS JUST 0
    `hospitalization month`             IS 1
    `hospitalization ground`            IS `Accidental injury`
    `age at hospitalization`            IS 45
    `causes`                            IS LIST Firefighting
    `fraud month`                       IS NOTHING
    `misrepresentation month`           IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit month`              IS JUST 3
    `wellness visit provider qualified` IS TRUE
    `written confirmation month`        IS JUST 4
    `dispute arisen`                    IS FALSE
    `unable to settle month`            IS NOTHING
    `arbitration commenced month`       IS NOTHING
    `valid arbitration award issued`    IS TRUE
    `written proof of claim month`      IS NOTHING
    `recovery sought month`             IS NOTHING
    `policy term months`                IS 12
#EVAL covered q1

