-- Q5: hospitalized for punching my own face to show off for my friends; no fraud or
-- misrepresentation. A deliberate, self-inflicted act is not an "accidental" injury,
-- so the ground is Neither -- see NOTES.md.
q5 MEANS Claim WITH
    `agreement signed`                  IS TRUE
    `premium paid month`                IS JUST 0
    `hospitalization month`             IS 1
    `hospitalization ground`            IS Neither
    `age at hospitalization`            IS 45
